        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'In a 2-player game, the Ace (Reverse) acts as a Skipâ€”use it to play two cards in a row.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Pay attention to 'Last One' calls. Catching an opponent and forcing them to draw is the most satisfying way to stall the game.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't play your 8 too earlyâ€”it's your insurance policy against being stuck with an unplayable last card.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'If you have multiple 2s, consider playing them separately to force consecutive opponents to draw, rather than stacking them on one player.',
